---
// IndustriesGrowth.astro
// "Where We Are Growing" — 3 target/growth sector cards.
// Uses section-container + page-container padding tokens.
---
---

<style>
  .target-sectors {
    padding-block: clamp(48px, 8vh, 96px);
    background: var(--ink, #090c14);
  }

  /* Header row — matches page-container */
  .section-header {
    max-width: 1440px;
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-inline: clamp(18px, 4vw, 48px);
    margin-bottom: clamp(28px, 4vh, 52px);
  }

  .section-tag {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .section-tag .line { width: 28px; height: 2px; background: var(--crimson); flex-shrink: 0; }
  .section-tag span {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: .2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--crimson-l);
  }

  .section-headline {
    font-family: var(--font-head);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 52px);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    line-height: .97;
    color: var(--white);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .intro-copy {
    font-size: clamp(14px, 1.6vw, 17px);
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--fog);
    max-width: 720px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  /* Card grid — inside page-container */
  .cards-wrap {
    max-width: 1440px;
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-inline: clamp(18px, 4vw, 48px);
  }

  .target-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 2px;
  }

  .target-card {
    background: var(--ink-2, #0a0d16);
    padding: clamp(22px, 3vw, 36px);
    border-top: 2px solid var(--teal-l, #14a898);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: background .3s;
  }
  .target-card:hover { background: rgba(13, 122, 110, .06); }
  .target-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; right: 0;
    width: 60px; height: 60px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(20,168,152,.08), transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .tc-icon {
    width: 40px; height: 40px;
    color: var(--teal-l, #14a898);
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    opacity: .85;
  }

  .tc-name {
    font-family: var(--font-head);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(20px, 2.5vw, 26px);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: .04em;
    color: var(--white);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .tc-status {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: .14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    background: rgba(20, 168, 152, .12);
    color: var(--teal-l, #14a898);
    padding: 3px 8px;
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .tc-desc {
    font-size: clamp(13px, 1.4vw, 14px);
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--fog);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .tc-opportunity {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--mist);
    line-height: 1.6;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(20, 168, 152, .1);
    padding-top: 14px;
  }
  .tc-opportunity strong {
    color: var(--teal-l, #14a898);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px)  { .target-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) { .target-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); } }
</style>

<section class="target-sectors" id="target" aria-labelledby="target-heading">

  <div class="section-header">
    <div class="section-tag reveal"><div class="line"></div><span>Where We Are Growing</span></div>
    <h2 class="section-headline reveal" id="target-heading">
      Equipment Ready.<br>Experience Transferable.
    </h2>
    <p class="intro-copy reveal">
      The equipment we build for cement plants, mines, and food processing operations is
      the same equipment these sectors need — the material characteristics differ, the
      engineering principles do not. If your operation handles bulk solids, powders, or
      granular material, Jayveecons has fabricated something like it before.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="cards-wrap">
    <div class="target-grid">

      <!-- Oil & Gas -->
      <article class="target-card reveal" aria-label="Oil and Gas sector">
        <svg class="tc-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v16a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2V8z"/>
          <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/>
          <line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/>
          <line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/>
        </svg>
        <h3 class="tc-name">Oil &amp; Gas</h3>
        <div class="tc-status">Diversifying With Proven Equipment</div>
        <p class="tc-desc">
          Upstream and midstream oil and gas operations move large volumes of bulk solids —
          proppants (frac sand), drilling muds, barite, and bentonite in drilling; petroleum
          coke, catalyst fines, and sulphur in refining. These materials demand enclosed,
          leak-proof conveying systems and pressure-rated containment vessels.
        </p>
        <div class="tc-opportunity">
          <strong>What we bring:</strong> Enclosed screw conveyors for dusty and hazardous
          bulk solids; belt and bucket systems for high-volume proppant handling; fabricated
          pressure vessels and storage systems; abrasion-resistant material selection from
          our mining work. ASME documentation available where specified.
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Pharmaceuticals -->
      <article class="target-card reveal" aria-label="Pharmaceuticals sector">
        <svg class="tc-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M9 3H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v4m6-6h10a2 2 0 012 2v4M9 3v18m0 0h10a2 2 0 002-2V9M9 21H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V9m0 0h18"/>
        </svg>
        <h3 class="tc-name">Pharmaceuticals</h3>
        <div class="tc-status">Diversifying With Proven Equipment</div>
        <p class="tc-desc">
          Pharmaceutical bulk handling requires precision, containment, and cleanability
          above all else. APIs, excipients, and formulation powders must be transferred
          without contamination, with full material traceability and equipment construction
          that permits clean-in-place or strip-down cleaning.
        </p>
        <div class="tc-opportunity">
          <strong>What we bring:</strong> Stainless steel screw conveyors and bucket
          elevators to Ra surface finish requirements; crevice-free weld geometry; contained
          transfer points; IBC handling systems; full material certification. Our food-grade
          fabrication experience is the direct foundation for pharma-grade work.
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Agriculture Processing -->
      <article class="target-card reveal" aria-label="Agriculture Processing sector">
        <svg class="tc-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M12 2a10 10 0 100 20A10 10 0 0012 2z"/>
          <path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/>
          <path d="M2 12h4M18 12h4M12 6V2M12 22v-4"/>
        </svg>
        <h3 class="tc-name">Agriculture Processing</h3>
        <div class="tc-status">Diversifying With Proven Equipment</div>
        <p class="tc-desc">
          Industrial-scale post-harvest operations — grain reception and storage, oilseed
          crushing, rice milling, sugar processing, and animal feed compounding — require
          handling systems that are high-throughput, gentle on product quality, and designed
          for the seasonal intensity of harvest intake.
        </p>
        <div class="tc-opportunity">
          <strong>What we bring:</strong> High-capacity bucket elevators and belt conveyors
          for grain intake; flat-bottom and hopper-bottom silos with aeration systems;
          rotary dryers for harvested grain moisture reduction; screw conveyors and feeders
          for milling and blending. Food-safe material selection is standard.
        </div>
      </article>

    </div>
  </div>

</section>